<blockquote class="uncited"><div><blockquote class="uncited"><div>Attached the reworked translation to romanian.</div></blockquote>Hi<br><br>Ideally we need Romanian versions of the voice prompts and the CPS. <br><br>See <br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=23&amp;t=3884&amp;p=30180#p30180" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=23&amp;t=3884&amp;p=30180#p30180</a><br><br>For the data files<br><br><br>With the voice prompts however, this may not be practical becasue the Text To Speech service we use does not list Romanian<br><br><a href="https://ttsmp3.com/" class="postlink">https://ttsmp3.com/</a><br><br>Most sites use Amazon Polly as the backend, and AFIK it does not support Romanian either.<br>But perhaps one of the other voices may be suitable, especially if you use some phonetic codes in the texts.</div></blockquote>I'll have a look.<br><br>Romanian does have special characters, but I haven't used them in the text translations above, which is acceptable in machine displayed/written text. However, due to space limits (max 16 chars on a row) some text labels have been severally butchered to fit.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5575">YO3IDG</a> — Tue Mar 26, 2024 6:22 am</p><hr />
